 Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif"><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" style="max-width:37.5em;background-color:#ffffff;border:1px solid #e9ecef;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;width:600px"><tbody><tr style="width:100%"><td><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" style="background-color:#1124cb;padding:18px 24px;text-align:center"><tbody><tr><td><img alt="arolariu.ro" src="https://di867tnz6fwga.cloudfront.net/brand-kits/071ab0be-ee67-4945-8807-29ecacfa97bc/primary/96729a74-5ced-4b21-bcc3-74e7d921cc03.png" style="display:block;outline:none;border:none;text-decoration:none;margin:0 auto;width:140px;height:auto;max-width:100%"/><p style="font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.92);margin:10px 0 0;margin-top:10px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0">Practical tools. Clean insights. Built for everyday spending.</p></td></tr></tbody></table><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" style="padding:28px 32px"><tbody><tr><td><p style="font-size:12px;line-height:12px;display:inline-block;border:1px solid #e9ecef;border-radius:999px;padding:6px 10px;color:#666666;background-color:#f8f9fa;margin:0 0 12px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:12px;margin-left:0">Invoices • Shared</p><p style="font-size:24px;line-height:30px;margin:0 0 14px;font-weight:700;color:#0b0b0c;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:14px;margin-left:0">An invoice was shared with you</p><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:24px;margin:0 0 14px;color:#0b0b0c;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:14px;margin-left:0">Hi Jane,</p><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:24px;margin:0 0 14px;color:#0b0b0c;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:14px;margin-left:0">Great news! <!-- -->arolariu.ro<!-- --> has shared an invoice with you on {brand}. This gives you access to view all the invoice details, including itemized products, merchant information, and analysis insights.<strong>Alex</strong></p><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" style="border:1px solid #e9ecef;border-radius:10px;background-color:#f8f9fa;padding:14px 14px;margin:18px 0"><tbody><tr><td><p style="font-size:14px;line-height:20px;margin:0 0 10px;font-weight:700;color:#0b0b0c;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:10px;margin-left:0">Share details</p><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" style="padding:2px 0"><tbody style="width:100%"><tr style="width:100%"><td data-id="__react-email-column" style="width:40%;padding-right:8px"><p style="font-size:12px;line-height:18px;margin:0;color:#666666;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0">Shared by</p></td><td data-id="__react-email-column" style="width:60%"><p style="font-size:12px;line-height:18px;margin:0;font-weight:600;color:#0b0b0c;font-family:ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &#x27;Liberation Mono&#x27;, &#x27;Courier New&#x27;, monospace;word-break:break-word;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0">Alex</p></td></tr></tbody></table><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" style="padding:2px 0"><tbody style="width:100%"><tr style="width:100%"><td data-id="__react-email-column" style="width:40%;padding-right:8px"><p style="font-size:12px;line-height:18px;margin:0;color:#666666;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0">Invoice ID</p></td><td data-id="__react-email-column" style="width:60%"><p style="font-size:12px;line-height:18px;margin:0;font-weight:600;color:#0b0b0c;font-family:ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &#x27;Liberation Mono&#x27;, &#x27;Courier New&#x27;, monospace;word-break:break-word;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0">abc-123</p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" style="background-color:#f8f9fa;border:1px solid #e9ecef;border-radius:10px;padding:16px;margin:0 0 14px"><tbody><tr><td><p style="font-size:14px;line-height:20px;margin:0 0 10px;font-weight:700;color:#0b0b0c;font-family:ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:10px;margin-left:0">What you can do</p><p style="font-size:14px;line-height:20px;margin:0 0 8px;color:#0b0b0c;font-family:ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:8px;margin-left:0">• <!-- -->View the complete invoice details and itemized breakdown</p><p style="font-size:14px;line-height:20px;margin:0 0 8px;color:#0b0b0c;font-family:ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:8px;margin-left:0">• <!-- -->See analysis insights and spending categories</p><p style="font-size:14px;line-height:20px;margin:0 0 8px;color:#0b0b0c;font-family:ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:8px;margin-left:0">• <!-- -->Download or print the invoice for your records</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:24px;margin:0 0 14px;color:#0b0b0c;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:14px;margin-left:0">Click the button above to access the shared invoice. This link will remain active as long as the sharing permissions are in place.</p><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:24px;margin:0 0 14px;color:#0b0b0c;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:14px;margin-left:0">Have questions about this share, or need help? Contact us at <a href="mailto:admin@arolariu.ro" style="color:#b404ff;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:none" target="_blank">admin@arolariu.ro</a>.</p><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:24px;margin:0;color:#0b0b0c;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0">Cheers,<br/>The arolariu.ro Team</p><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" style="text-align:center;padding:8px 0 4px"><tbody><tr><td><a href="https://arolariu.ro/domains/invoices/view-invoice/abc-123" style="color:#ffffff;text-decoration-line:none;display:inline-block;background-color:#b404ff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 18px;font-size:16px;line-height:20px;font-weight:700" target="_blank">View shared invoice</a><p style="font-size:12px;line-height:18px;margin:12px 0 0;color:#666666;margin-top:12px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0">If the button doesn&#x27;t work, open this link:<!-- --> <a href="https://arolariu.ro/domains/invoices/view-invoice/abc-123" style="color:#b404ff;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:none" target="_blank">https://arolariu.ro/domains/invoices/view-invoice/abc-123</a></p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><hr style="width:100%;border:none;border-color:#e9ecef;border-top:1px solid #eaeaea;margin:0"/><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" style="padding:18px 32px 22px;text-align:center"><tbody><tr><td><p style="font-size:12px;line-height:18px;margin:0 0 8px;color:#666666;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:8px;margin-left:0"><a href="https://arolariu.ro" style="color:#b404ff;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:none" target="_blank">arolariu.ro</a></p><p style="font-size:12px;line-height:18px;margin:0 0 8px;color:#666666;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:8px;margin-left:0">Bucharest, Romania<!-- --> •<!-- --> <a href="mailto:admin@arolariu.ro" style="color:#b404ff;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:none" target="_blank">admin@arolariu.ro</a></p><p style="font-size:11px;line-height:16px;margin:0;color:#666666;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0">© 2022-2026 arolariu.ro. All rights reserved.</p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><!--/$--></body></html>"`;

